          "type": "text",
          "id": "pvt-spec",
          "name": "Spec",
          "fill": "$--color-secondary",
          "content": "One click in Explorer or Changes opens the file or diff in the checkout's one preview slot: the title is drawn in the theme's italic variant (--text-preview-slant, an oblique of the same Inter face; pen substitutes the family's own italic) and the tooltip and accessibility label read \"name · Preview\". The next single click replaces the slot in place. Double-click on the Explorer row or the title, the first edit, Keep Open (⇧⌘K) or a drag promotes the tab: the same slot, the title upright, nothing else changes. Colours, the close button and the keycap are the tab's ordinary ones (B17). A dirty preview is never replaced: it is promoted where it sits and the new preview opens beside it (B8).",
